This project builds on the following work, which is downloaded by setup.sh and is
not redistributed in this repository:

- Causal Forcing (https://github.com/thu-ml/Causal-Forcing), Apache License 2.0.
  stream.py contains a modified version of its KV-cached self-attention: the shifting
  cache is replaced by a ring buffer, and RoPE factors are passed in per frame.
